flowchart LR
 _Prelude_(["Infiltrate the Port Authority to locate intel on the nuclear waste convoy."])
 _A1_(["Watching from a distance, the team waits for a chance to enter the docks."])
 _A1_1_(["Timing their approach with a guard change, they rush through while security is distracted."])
 _A1_2_(["The team waits in the parking lot for the Port Authority manager to show up."])
 _A1_C1_{"As he reaches his car, Interrogator and Cat Burglar attempt a quiet takedown."}
 _A1_C1F_["The manager is wrestled to the ground but kicks his way free and shouts for aid."]
 _A1_C2_{"Hacker and Reviver intercept the manager as he tries to escape."}
 _A1_C2F_["The manager fights off the crew, with his cries alerting the nearby guard."]
 _A1_3_(["As the guard steps over to investigate, the manager is finally downed with a sharp gut punch."])
 _A1_C3_{"Lurking nearby, Reviver prepares to take out the guard as Hacker distracts him."}
 _A1_C3P_["The guard gasps as Reviver clamps his brachial plexus, and he quickly collapses."]
 _A1_4_(["Hacker and Reviver hide the body as the others drag the manager to a nearby building."])
 _A2_1_(["Interrogator helps Cat Burglar secure the manager to a chair using zip ties."])
 _A2_2_(["Bound and frightened, he strains against the chair, voice cracking as he asks what they want."])
 _A2_3_(["Interrogator questions him about forthcoming inbound shipments at the docks."])
 _A2_4_(["The manager swears he doesn&#39;t know anything, claiming it&#39;s not his department."])
 _A2_C1_{"Interrogator produces a cigar cutter and slides it gently over the manager&#39;s index finger."}
 _A2_C1P_["With the cutter biting into his flesh, the manager caves when the blade hits bone."]
 _A3_(["He tells Interrogator that the inbound manifest is stored on a secure server."])
 _A3_1_(["When Interrogator presses for more details, he directs them to the Port Authority terminals."])
 _A3_2_(["Hacker and Cat Burglar leave in search of the convoy intel."])
 _A3_3_(["Narrowly avoiding a guard patrol, they finally reach the Port Authority building."])
 _A3_C1_{"The front entrance is guarded, so Cat Burglar searches for an alternative way in."}
 _A3_C1P_["Cat Burglar finds a parcel hatch and squeezes through, emerging in the mail room."]
 _A4_(["Cat Burglar then unlocks a side window and lets Hacker inside."])
 _A4_1_(["Moving quietly, the pair enter the dispatch room and locate a terminal."])
 _A4_C1_{"Using a stealth virus, Hacker tries to access the secure server."}
 _A4_C1P_["The malware blends with the system&#39;s routine processes, granting access without detection."]
 _A5_(["Hacker scours the system to find more information on the nuclear convoy."])
 _A5_1_(["The manifest shows no signs of any forthcoming nuclear shipments, puzzling Hacker."])
 _A5_2_(["Hacker calls Interrogator to let him know the bad news."])
 _A5_3_(["Interrogator kicks over a stack of crates and tells Reviver to fetch his car battery."])
 _A5_4_(["The manager protests as Interrogator clamps it to his nipples and accuses him of lying."])
 _A5_5_(["A jolt of current rips through the prisoner&#39;s flesh, his body locking up as he passes out."])
 _A5_C1_{"Reviver curses Interrogator&#39;s overexuberance and tries to revive the manager."}
 _A5_C1F_["The manager remains still, his chest rising once more before falling quiet."]
 _A5_C2_{"Detecting no pulse, Reviver uses the battery to shock him back to life."}
 _A5_C2F_["The voltage does nothing but burn a fresh welt across the manager&#39;s chest."]
 _A5_6_(["One final attempt at CPR is performed but it&#39;s all in vain as the manager is clearly dead."])
 _A5_7_(["Interrogator calls Hacker and tells the team to keep looking for any useful intel."])
 _A5_8_(["While Hacker rechecks the database, Cat Burglar searches through filing cabinets."])
 _A5_9_(["Cat Burglar is spotted in the window by one of the guards, and the pair is caught in the act."])
 _A5F_(["With their comrades unreachable, the others retreat, realizing things have gone badly wrong."])
 _A1_C1P_["The manager is subdued and silenced without alerting the guard."]
 _A2_(["The crew hauls its prisoner across the lot toward an old maintenance shed."])
 _A5_C1P_["With a gasp and a twitch, their captive comes to, soaked in sweat and terrified."]
 _A6_(["Interrogator questions why the nuclear convoy is missing from the inbound manifest."])
 _A6_1_(["Choking back tears, the manager reveals it&#39;s logged under a false name for security reasons."])
 _A6_2_(["He tells them to look for shipments from the New Clear Fishing Company."])
 _A6_3_(["Interrogator informs Hacker, who finally identifies the convoy&#39;s route and timings."])
 _A6_4_(["Hacker then searches for intel on the security detail accompanying the shipment."])
 _A6_5_(["A restricted logistics file is found, but it requires high level clearance to access."])
 _A6_C1_{"Hacker attempts to spoof the requested credentials and unlock the file."}
 _A6_C1P_["Hacker&#39;s bypass attempt fools the system, and the convoy details begin to load."]
 _A7_(["The file reveals a convoy of four armored SUVs escorting a reinforced transport truck."])
 _A7_1_(["Hacker downloads the file and they exit the office the way they entered."])
 _A7_2_(["On their way back, Hacker and Cat Burglar are spotted and trailed by a patrol guard."])
 _A7_3_(["Sensing the trespassers are up to no good, he draws a weapon and orders them to halt."])
 _A7_4_(["Inside, Interrogator and Reviver overhear their teammates trying to placate the guard."])
 _A7_5_(["Interrogator realizes they need the manager&#39;s help to get out of this situation."])
 _A7_C1_{"Interrogator tells the manager to go outside and reassure the guard, or both of them will die."}
 _A7_C1P_["Stepping outside, the manager vouches for the team and apologizes for the mix-up."]
 _A8_(["The guard stands down, and the crew reconvenes back inside the maintenance shed."])
 _A8_1_(["Interrogator tells the manager his ordeal is over but threatens his family if he talks."])
 _A8_2_(["The crew escorts him back to his car, forcing their victim to drive them off site."])
 _A8_3_(["The manager barely holds it together as he pulls out with his tormentors sat beside him."])
 _A8S_(["Having secured the convoy intel, the crew departs the docks in a buoyant mood."])
 _A2_C1F_["As the blade cuts into his flesh, the manager grimaces but refuses to yield."]
 _A2_C2_{"Interrogator pulls the manager&#39;s pants down, threatening to amputate something more valuable."}
 _A2_C2P_["The threat of castration works, and the manager starts to talk."]
 _A3_C1F_["Cat Burglar is caught trying to climb up the side of the building."]
 _B4_(["Before climbing down, Cat Burglar discreetly alerts the others of the unfolding situation."])
 _B4_1_(["They protest their innocence, but the security guard isn&#39;t buying it."])
 _B4_2_(["Hacker and Cat Burglar are taken to the security office for questioning."])
 _B4_3_(["Realizing her teammates have gone dark, Interrogator cuts the manager free."])
 _B4_C1_{"Interrogator urges the manager to cooperate and follow her lead."}
 _B4_C1P_["The manager pleads for mercy and agrees to do whatever the team asks of him."]
 _B5_(["Interrogator smartens up the prisoner&#39;s appearance and says they&#39;re going on a little walk."])
 _B5_1_(["As they approach the admin office, Interrogator runs through the manager&#39;s cover story."])
 _B5_2_(["He&#39;ll pretend the crew are technicians investigating lapses in radiation safety protocol."])
 _B5_3_(["The manager starts his spiel but the guard scoffs, saying nobody told him about an inspection."])
 _B5_C1_{"Reviver warns of the contamination risks, using medical jargon to rattle the guard."}
 _B5_C1F_["The guard frowns as Reviver&#39;s rambling explanation starts to unravel."]
 _B5_C2_{"Reviver pivots, asking if the guard has experienced any odd symptoms lately."}
 _B5_C2P_["When the guard mentions fatigue, Reviver convinces him he may have been exposed."]
 _B6_(["The manager orders Hacker and Cat Burglar&#39;s immediate release."])
 _B6_1_(["Reviver asks the guards to keep the area clear while the contamination is investigated."])
 _B6_C1_{"Hacker and Cat Burglar scour the office for intel on the nuclear convoy."}
 _B6_C1P_["Cat Burglar finds some high-level login credentials inside a desk drawer."]
 _B7_(["Hacker uses the credentials to log in to the secure server."])
 _B7_1_(["The convoy&#39;s manifest is listed under a fake company name: New Clear Fishing Company."])
 _B7_2_(["Hacker then finds the convoy&#39;s security detail outlined in a protected file."])
 _B7_3_(["Four armored SUVs will be dispatched to escort a reinforced transport truck."])
 _B7_4_(["Intel secured, the crew departs, taking the shaken manager back to his vehicle."])
 _B7S_(["With the convoy’s weaknesses exposed, the next phase of their explosive plan can begin."])
 _A5_C2P_["The manager snaps awake mid-spasm, his eyes wide and mouth frothing."]
 _B5_C1P_["Spooked by talk of cell damage and seizures, the guard quickly stands down."]
 _B4_C1F_["The manager backs into a corner, terrified of what he&#39;ll be asked to do."]
 _B4_C2_{"Reviver approaches and tries to ease his anxiety."}
 _B4_C2P_["Following Reviver&#39;s breathing techniques, the manager calms and starts to comply."]
 _A7_C1F_["The manager steps out stammering and sweating, making the guard suspicious."]
 _A7_C2_{"As he reaches for his gun, Interrogator and Reviver decide to bum-rush the guard."}
 _A7_C2P_["Interrogator slams the guard down and Reviver lands a hard punch on his throat."]
 _A8_4_(["With the guard taken care of, the crew drags the manager back to his car."])
 _A8_5_(["Piling in the vehicle, Interrogator orders him to drive them out of the docks."])
 _A8_6_(["As they exit, Interrogator threatens reprisals if the manager speaks of what happened today."])
 _A7S_(["Intel secured, the crew escapes the docks, phase one of their grand plan now complete."])
 _A1_C2P_["On the second attempt, the manager is finally subdued, his cries muffled by Hacker."]
 _A7_C2F_["The ambush falls flat as the guard sees them coming, firing several shots their way."]
 _A7_6_(["Hacker and Interrogator are downed, the gunfire drawing more guards to the scene."])
 _A7_7_(["Reviver and Cat Burglar give up, unwilling to take a bullet for nothing."])
 _A7F_(["The rest of the crew is arrested on charges of trespassing and torture."])
 _A6_C1F_["Hacker&#39;s spoof is flagged as suspicious, and the terminal is locked down."]
 _A6_C2_{"Seeing another terminal in a locked room, Cat Burglar tries to find a way inside."}
 _A6_C2F_["Cat Burglar tries to lift the door off its hinges, triggering an alarm."]
 _A6_7_(["Hacker and Cat Burglar hide to avoid the incoming guard."])
 _A6_C3_{"Once the guard has swept the area, Hacker and Cat Burglar try to find another way in."}
 _A6_C3P_["Cat Burglar scours the office and finds a security pass that opens the door discreetly."]
 _A6_6_(["Hacker approaches the terminal and bypasses the clearance check on the second attempt."])
 _A6_C2P_["Cat Burglar spots a loose ceiling panel, climbs through, drops inside, and unlocks the door."]
 _A2_C2F_["Faced with the prospect of losing his manhood, the manager summons the strength to break free."]
 _A2_5_(["The crew scrambles to restrain him, with Interrogator driving a brutal punch into his face."])
 _A2_6_(["As the manager is tied back to the chair, Reviver notices his jaw is dislocated."])
 _A2_C3_{"Reviver tries to reset the manager&#39;s jaw so Interrogator can interrogate him."}
 _A2_C3P_["Reviver snaps his jaw back into place and the manager groans, slurring out a response."]
 _B6_C1F_["After combing through numerous documents and terminals, no mention of the convoy is found."]
 _B6_C2_{"The Port Authority manager is brought in to aid Hacker and Cat Burglar&#39;s search."}
 _B6_C2F_["The manager pretends to help the team but deliberately hides some important documents."]
 _B6_2_(["Cat Burglar starts to lose his cool and threatens the manager with violence."])
 _B6_3_(["The angry exchange is overheard by a guard, who senses something isn&#39;t right."])
 _B6_4_(["A discreet call to the nuclear plant confirms the crew’s story is a fabrication."])
 _B6F_(["The guard calls for backup, and the crew is charged with trespassing and torture."])
 _B5_C2F_["Smirking, he informs Reviver he&#39;s dealing with a pain in the ass right now."]
 _B5_4_(["Reviver loses his cool and gets up in the guard&#39;s face, starting a brawl."])
 _B5_5_(["When Interrogator joins in, a second guard rushes over, and the manager drops the act."])
 _B5_6_(["The manager rushes out to raise the alarm, drawing more guards to the scene."])
 _B5_7_(["Hacker and Cat Burglar manage to escape through an office window, evading the guards."])
 _B5F_(["The others are arrested and hit with charges of torture and trespassing."])
 _A4_C1F_["Security protocols kick in mid-process, locking the terminal and sounding an alarm."]
 _A4_2_(["The pair feigns innocence as a security guard comes to investigate."])
 _A4_3_(["Their explanations fall short, and the guard draws his weapon, forcing them into his office."])
 _B6_C2P_["With the manager&#39;s help, Cat Burglar obtains some high-level security credentials."]
 _A2_C3F_["Reviver accidentally breaks the man&#39;s jaw, causing him to scream and pass out."]
 _A2F_(["With their only lead unable to speak, the crew panics and pulls the plug on the mission."])
 _A1_C3F_["Reviver is caught and threatened as the guard barks into his radio for backup."]
 _A1F_(["The rest of the crew scrambles for the exit, leaving Reviver to take the rap."])
 _A6_C3F_["The pair gets caught by the guard while trying to smash their way into the locked office."]
 _A6F_(["Noticing the guard activity, Interrogator and Reviver slink off, the mission a bust."])
 _B4_C2F_["The manager recoils from Reviver, believing he&#39;s going to be murdered."]
 _B4_C3_{"Interrogator and Reviver reassure the manager he&#39;ll live if he complies."}
 _B4_C3P_["The manager finally sees sense and asks what they want him to do."]
 _B4_C3F_["Sweat pouring down his face, he grabs a hammer and backs away, ready to fight for his life."]
 _B4_4_(["As the team tries to disarm him, Reviver takes a nasty blow to the temple."])
 _B4_5_(["Interrogator grabs the hammer and cracks the manager in the chest, collapsing his lungs."])
 _B4F_(["With all her teammates either brained or detained, Interrogator calls off the mission."])

